### Realization
Query Planner is only as good as its statistics.
Statistics do not execute the query.
Statistics influence the planner's decision.

### ANALYZE

Purpose:
Hindi nito ino-optimize ang query.
Hindi nito ginagawa ang index.
Hindi nito binibilang ang buong table sa bawat query.
Ang ginagawa nito ay:
Ina-update nito ang statistics na ginagamit ng Query Planner para makapili ng mas tamang execution plan.

### Mabagal ang query
Workflow
User:
